{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636530/extras/3840x1240_2.png?t=1746350001\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <i>Dungeon Maiden: Survivor</i>! Command magical girls through monster-infested dungeons, blending horde-slaying combat with roguelite builds and character customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636530/extras/01.gif?t=1746350001\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 <i>Maiden Assault</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead unique heroines into procedurally-generated labyrinths, battling endless waves with flashy AoE skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 <i>Cathartic Combat</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn monster hordes into gold showers! Chain combos with strategic dodging for ultimate farming frenzy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636530/extras/02.gif?t=1746350001\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 <i>Rescue System</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Save captured maidens to build your ultimate battle harem with synergistic team buffs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 <i>Gold Obsession</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect coins to empower characters and unlock secret content - your key to dungeon domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636530/extras/2025-04-14_18-32-54.gif?t=1746350001\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 <i>Special CG Unlock</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat brings... alternative rewards. Certain scenes are worth losing for.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 <i>Progression Depth</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade stats, unlock meta-skills, and evolve combat styles through each rebirth cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636530/extras/2025-04-14_18-46-27.gif?t=1746350001\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 <i>Fashion Warfare</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip cosmetic gear with stat boosts - annihilate enemies in style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 <i>Mystic Relics</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss drops grant game-breaking combos. Stack modifiers to become unstoppable!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3636530?t=1746350001","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3636530?t=1746350001","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636530/45448b0fe3375336f2cf6b701795dfab5cf9fac2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746350001","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636530/45448b0fe3375336f2cf6b701795dfab5cf9fac2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746350001","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,4,5],"notes":"This game may contain \"revealing clothing\" and \"sexual themes\" that may not be suitable for all age groups."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636530/extras/3840x1240_2.png?t=1746350001\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <i>Dungeon Maiden: Survivor</i>! Command magical girls through monster-infested dungeons, blending horde-slaying combat with roguelite builds and character customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636530/extras/01.gif?t=1746350001\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 <i>Maiden Assault</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead unique heroines into procedurally-